// N27-AB — Pacto de la Espada, tier 0: "Hoja Muda" / "Mute Blade".
//
// The blade before it has a voice (`PactBladeSkill::Voice` is tier 1): a
// patron-forged edge that is simply there, and simply cuts. Available the
// instant `/pact blade summon` flips `Pact::blade_summoned`, with no skill
// point spent -- `Simple(None, ..)` in the manifest.
//
// This is the Warlock's REAL attack while the blade is out, not a filler: an
// `InnateAux` ability has no equipped tool backing it, so there is no weapon
// primary underneath it to fall back on. Hence no cooldown and a repeatable
// ~0.85 s cycle, priced in energy rather than time. Damage sits above the
// shipped cantrip band (booming_blade 14, eldritch_blast 8x2) and below a
// class signature burst (rogue ambush 30 on a 15 s cooldown), which is where
// a spammable no-cooldown strike belongs.
//
// `source: Some(Arcane)` is load-bearing, not flavour ("The Veil -- arcane
// study, bloodline, PACT, or art"). It makes `Attack::apply_attack` treat the
// swing as magic, which:
//   * exempts it from the non-proficient weapon penalty
//     (`combat::Attack::proficiency_multiplier` returns 1.0 for `is_magic`) --
//     the blade is not a weapon the Warlock is or isn't trained with, and
//     `AbilityInfo::new` would otherwise stamp it with whatever tool happens
//     to be in `ActiveMainhand`;
//   * rolls magic accuracy vs magic evasion, and scales off `spell_power`
//     rather than raw weapon damage, which is the right channel for a caster;
//   * makes it suppressible by `Antimagic` / a severed pact's `disable_magic`,
//     which is correct for patron-granted power.
// `school` is deliberately unset: this is a boon ability, not a catalogued
// spell, and it is absent from the spell compendium (so the cast-time class
// filter and the Tome-possession gate both pass it through untouched).
//
// `Slash` hardcodes DamageKind::Slashing in common/src/comp/melee.rs; there is
// no RON-authorable damage kind on MeleeConstructorKind.
BasicMelee(
    energy_cost: 10,
    buildup_duration: 0.35,
    swing_duration: 0.1,
    hit_timing: 0.5,
    recover_duration: 0.4,
    melee_constructor: (
        kind: Slash(
            damage: 20,
            poise: 10,
            knockback: 4,
            energy_regen: 0,
        ),
        range: 3.2,
        angle: 30.0,
    ),
    meta: (source: Some(Arcane)),
)
